"act_sprint":{"foc":[["12vye6g1kff","1ci09r0vv9n","t9l14fi00k","zmuw689w3l"],"Krátce, naplno a s plnou pauzou.","Short, all-out, with full rest."],"pos":[["1jlq7o3cnzo","1u76aollp5t","20tso1e8c95","yrh2xxwca5"],"Rovná volná dráha. Nejdřív se pořádně rozehřej.","A flat clear lane. Warm up properly first."],"exe":[["12d4069zq5t","ed3w2s2had","jr4gd8y6wt","ozqapnq1ia"],"Plynule se rozběhni a drž vysokou rychlost na daném úseku. Potom zpomal do chůze.","Build up smoothly and hold high speed over the set distance. Then slow to a walk."],"wat":[["1265xwfys1a","7gawlpijk0","7grbzr1j7w","om6ww4sya"],"Nebrzdi prudce. Mezi úseky si odpočiň.","Don't brake hard. Rest between runs."],"pro":[["kx8tg5noeg","tzplznvexe","zxpytb5yil"],"Lehčí: běh na tři čtvrtiny. Těžší: delší úsek nebo víc úseků.","Easier: three-quarter speed. Harder: a longer distance or more runs."]},
