"act_swim":{"foc":[["1rg8he9iapj","1yo0sa3iz9q","27vjh3sfaos","8e9diln8db"],"Dech je součást techniky, ne přerušení.","Breathing is part of the stroke, not a break from it."],"pos":[["563ofzstl7","bgzupld6p4","lw5pxrj8a4","s6pczz3tux"],"Místo určené k plavání a styl, který ovládáš.","A place meant for swimming and a stroke you know."],"exe":[["12kh1rnoi9s","1lunzs3u27t","1r8pm9292f7","zb0sty1frk"],"Plav úseky, které zvládneš s klidným dechem. Odpočívej podle potřeby.","Swim lengths you can manage with calm breathing. Rest as needed."],"wat":[["22gyt7bvvnn","2fbvxnaew3k","jscsg4ggwm","qsf0krcf3n"],"Nezadržuj dech. Neplav sám tam, kde není dozor.","Don't hold your breath. Don't swim alone where there's no supervision."],"pro":[["20t259e9qgq","jn7j0n7hcg","o3sv2lq4b9"],"Lehčí: kratší úseky a delší pauzy. Těžší: delší úseky nebo kratší pauzy.","Easier: shorter lengths and longer rests. Harder: longer lengths or shorter rests."]},
