"activehang":{"foc":[["1ck2pumpm0b","24qsmfrt5np","3b0ik8xnkz","xzk437j65n"],"Ramena stáhni dolů od uší. Nevisíš jako pytel.","Pull your shoulders down from your ears. Don't hang like a sack."],"pos":[["1f4lvb6cyl4","1wdnmiyf1hx","47bwlkjd67","gtq35ioqvg"],"Vis na hrazdě nadhmatem, paže propnuté.","Overhand hang on the bar, arms straight."],"exe":[["172uqjnmud7","20nj0e0gqli","nrm6vxt7g1","y5izq8dedc"],"Stáhni ramena dolů, tělo se o kousek zvedne. Drž a dýchej.","Draw your shoulders down so your body rises a little. Hold and breathe."],"wat":[["1rvrflwfumu","22ga0yts6rn","m7787qtlgz","n0b5l9ve09"],"Lokty nepokrčuj. Nehoupej se.","Don't bend the elbows. No swinging."],"pro":[["1tk2qpp21sr","261vef3fpcw","2ci26aorcyd","dk4t0qk1i7"],"Lehčí: špičky na zemi. Těžší: delší výdrž.","Easier: toes on the floor. Harder: a longer hold."]},
