"seatedcalf":{"foc":[["1om6nvcqt2g","1tvgnjs6w7p","6fphsvi9za","y7hptuens4"],"S pokrčeným kolenem pracuje spodní část lýtka.","With the knee bent, the lower calf does the work."],"pos":[["146r3au15bc","23ypkjf3kqw","2bq4w7vypjy","on8bhojqk1"],"Sed na stroji, přední části chodidel na nášlapu, opěrka na stehnech.","Seated in the machine, balls of your feet on the step, pad on your thighs."],"exe":[["16zbngllz7s","22wbsgwvm2i","29mwozaef8c","ou56n29er0"],"Zvedni paty co nejvýš. Pomalu je spusť do protažení.","Raise your heels as high as you can. Lower slowly into the stretch."],"wat":[["1rx9w1fml13","3839jhdogp","f8f9eenpmi","n87pmpf31e"],"Nepéruj. Zadek zůstává na sedadle.","No bouncing. Hips stay on the seat."],"pro":[["1ltivjuay4n","1xmq3bd0hvt","219vssasvzf"],"Lehčí: menší váha. Těžší: pauza nahoře.","Easier: less weight. Harder: a pause at the top."]},
